message: "If you use this software, please cite the software repository and the associated article."
title: "URSA Orographic-Lift Adapter"
type: software
version: 0.2.1
date-released: 2026-08-28
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Liu
    given-names: Haobo
    affiliation: "School of Aeronautic Science and Engineering, Beihang University"
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Ke
    affiliation: "School of Aeronautic Science and Engineering, Beihang University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/HaoboL/ursa-orographic-lift"
url: "https://github.com/HaoboL/ursa-orographic-lift"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, physics-guided adapter that adds upstream terrain history
  to fast orographic-lift estimators, suppressing unsupported positive lift
  behind upstream ridges while retaining a separate adverse-flow exposure
  state for warning and accepted-support decisions.
keywords:
  - orographic lift
  - terrain sheltering
  - wind estimation
  - fixed-wing UAV
  - route planning
